    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in Excess of 249,950\n\n31 Barr Na Haille is a spacious 3 bedroom semi-detached property that is less than a minutes' walk from a breath-taking \"cliff walk\". \nFeatures of the property include; \n3 double bedrooms, the main is ensuite and it comes with the benefit of a balcony which enjoys sea views. \nOpen Plan Living Accommodation. \nChildren's playground and Rosslare Rangers Soccer Club, which is within a short walk. \nThe amenities of Rosslare Harbour are within a ten minute walk.\nBus and train links to Wexford Town and beyond.\nFerry terminal to England, France and Spain. \nShort drive to two National Schools and St. Helens Golf Club. This is an ideal family or retirement home, some of the benefits of living on this small mixed estate are listed above. Please give Helen a ring to organise a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.33m x 2.1m\n\n\nCloakroom - 2.1m x 1.5m\nWith tiled flooring and splashback, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nOpen Plan Living Area - \n\n\nLiving - Dining Area - 6.55m x 3.5m\nWith part tiled floors, open fireplace and double doors opening up to back garden.\n\nKitchen - 3.87m x 2.03m\nWith waist and eye level storage and tiled flooring and part tiled walls.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 5.41m x 1.41m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.47m x 2.92m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.82m\nWith bath. w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.62m x 3.52m\nWith fitted robes.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.8m x 1.18m\n\n\nBedroom 3 Ensuite & Balcony - 5.86m x 4.47m\nGreat size Master bedroom with shower ensuite (Triton T90 Electric Shower; W.C. and W.H.B).and door to a small balcony which enjoys sea views.\n\n"
      },
